# `GENRE-CONNECTOR-SPELLING`/`GENRE-NODE-SPELLING`: the scoping runs in BOTH directions. A flowchart's word and a
# statechart's word are line errors under `block`, by the same allowlist that
# makes `edge` a line error under those two — no per-keyword code, and the
# same named diagnostic pointing at the word this genre does use.
figdown 0.1 block
node a "A"
node b "B"
flowline a -> b
transition a -> b
state c "C"
edge a -> b
